<Layout title="Firmware Drift Is Your Biggest Security Risk — And Only an AI Agent Can Fix It at Scale — Metify" description="CVE-2024-0762, Zenbleed, Conti ransomware — firmware vulnerabilities are actively exploited and invisible to traditional security tools. MOJO's compliance agent fixes drift continuously.">
